{# INCIDENTS I REPORTED (ME·12, #19) — the person's own reports, newest first:
   the reference and the area's word for it, when, and where it stands.

   Design: variants-my-dashboard/a.html, card ME·12. The design's index chip
   is the workspace's reference and does not ship (NoWorkshopLabelsTest).

   EVERY INSTANT CARRIES ITS MACHINE VALUE, so the frame prints it in the
   reader's own timezone; the text inside is what a page with no script
   shows. This morning's report says "today" and the clock; anything older
   says the day.

   → Uhifadhi\Incident\Me\IncidentMyCards #}
<div class="c" data-me="incidents"><span class="tab">Incidents I reported<span class="src">&middot; {{ reading.monthSubline }}</span></span>
    {% for incident in reading.latest %}
        <div class="rln"><span><b>{{ incident.reference }}</b> {{ incident.subcategory.label|lower }}</span><span class="mono d">{% if reading.isToday(incident) %}today <time datetime="{{ incident.reportedAt|date('c') }}" data-localtime-format="clock">{{ incident.reportedAt|date('H:i') }}</time>{% else %}<time datetime="{{ incident.reportedAt|date('c') }}" data-localtime-format="daystamp">{{ incident.reportedAt|date('D j M · H:i')|lower }}</time>{% endif %} &middot; <span class="chip {{ reading.chip(incident) }}">{{ reading.words(incident) }}</span></span></div>
    {% else %}
        <div class="rln"><span class="d">No incidents reported yet.</span></div>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if reading.reportUrl %}<div class="sxfoot"><span class="sp"></span><a class="tgl" href="{{ reading.reportUrl }}">Report one &rarr;</a></div>{% endif %}
</div>
